{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_124_title", "source_sha256": "593e2a3931849d8b1a5064f4ad522b82c8469d222d719d4c54f61128d83fc7a3", "ja": "あなたがいてくれるから", "zh": "因为有你在", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_124_synopsis", "source_sha256": "90ed499a66e6ba6c29fd2ea2d3c2e98eb2f88f4653ba21960349fc53cedb8720", "ja": "「春香に恋をしている」というファンから\r\n手紙をもらう春香。その気持ちには答えられ\r\nないし、もし自分に好きな人ができたら……\r\n等思い悩んだ末、「アイドルとして、ずっと\r\nファンの傍にいる」という答えを出す。", "zh": "春香收到了一封粉丝来信，上面写着\n“我恋慕着春香”。她既无法回应这份心意，\n又在苦恼如果自己有了喜欢的人该怎么办……\n一番思索后，她给出的答案是“作为偶像，\n要一直陪伴在粉丝身边”。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_124_1000_001har", "source_sha256": "ddd5a085dcf38111109d19f7fff8a41a71b9bd0ea5f3e66205be2e6b8d9f5c6c", "ja": "聞いてもらったのは、私の新しい歌で\n『I'm yours』でした！　どうでしたか？", "zh": "我让你听的是我的新歌《I'm yours》！感觉怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_124_1001_audience", "source_sha256": "ded309b31cb70e29e6c2bfe94427d99db37a028973e85a8d06b5c4a996e46f0c", "ja": "ワアアアアアッ！！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_124_1002_001har", "source_sha256": "505f06d5a1f00e8d61e57adf502c9c1dd8edebf31957b82e29f241abaaf81169", "ja": "私のファンでいてくれるみんなへ。\n精いっぱい、気持ちをこめて歌いました……。", "zh": "献给一直支持我的大家。\n我用尽全力，怀着满满的心意唱了这首歌……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_124_1003_001har", "source_sha256": "2e9e39f5a664a4ae826f02a241d5693409768738696756fdf8a62520b60e9c3d", "ja": "私はこれからも、ずっとずっと、アイドルでいます。\nアイドルとして、みんなの傍にいたいです。", "zh": "今后我也会一直一直当偶像。作为偶像，我想一直陪在大家身边。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_124_1004_001har", "source_sha256": "206430111bb67dceab68aa690226ededa469541c1f1b7fcd02b3d673cf73f64e", "ja": "だからこれからも、応援、よろしくお願いします！", "zh": "所以今后也请继续为我加油！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_124_1005_audience", "source_sha256": "ded309b31cb70e29e6c2bfe94427d99db37a028973e85a8d06b5c4a996e46f0c", "ja": "ワアアアアアッ！！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_124_1006_p", "source_sha256": "9e6976733979d7759daccaae2f3fb733900fcdf0faf9afe7909df485fb7ba1d6", "ja": "みんな、お疲れさま！\nまずは無事に終わってよかったな。", "zh": "大家辛苦了！\n首先能顺利结束真是太好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_124_1007_018ele", "source_sha256": "c3781100b550c14df39592306401eff4e24518265c42b49ee8f065a7428c5cbe", "ja": "今日のステージ、みんなの声がすごかったネ～！\nビリビリッて体が震えるくらいだったヨ。", "zh": "今天的舞台上，大家的声音太厉害了～！\n震得我全身都发麻了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_124_1008_036kan", "source_sha256": "34f0501d153a97b328d1a1608cf6cb939ec0c90a52b8e6b1086c2fc80b4772a1", "ja": "はい、圧倒されちゃいました！\n春香さんの人気、すごいなって……♪", "zh": "是的，完全被震撼到了！春香小姐的人气，真是不得了啊……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_124_1009_034ayu", "source_sha256": "c5c52ab8c94b2ece33e44607ff039dd894bbdb62c351bbf059fcea71d0e6bd71", "ja": "なのに緊張してないし、新曲もバッチリってね！\nさすがだよな～。", "zh": "明明都这样了，你却一点也不紧张，新歌也表现得无可挑剔！\n真不愧是你啊～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_124_1010_001har", "source_sha256": "884f74904037009dfc9c33e8a161a7e170daeaf7fd146c1fdbe26fff243de20f", "ja": "それは、もちろん！\n心強い味方が、4人もいてくれたからだよ♪", "zh": "那当然啦！\n因为有4位可靠的伙伴陪着我嘛♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_124_1011_006mak", "source_sha256": "8ea8e33c96fefa93b248d604ed0d2917336102c733f89a12c969b310b9fe1c05", "ja": "よかった、すっかりいつもどおりの春香だね。\n安心したよ。", "zh": "太好了，春香已经完全恢复平时的样子了。\n我就放心了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_124_1012_001har", "source_sha256": "b215812b52758e5b63fe64de7181333f4ca37da67776740d8f3d815db3b16e81", "ja": "真……。\nもしかして、心配かけちゃってた？", "zh": "真……\n难道让你担心了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_124_1013_006mak", "source_sha256": "e6056439216409b1eb2b88a692337b84c764e3195c04e1498f90087d6ee1fa96", "ja": "手紙の件もあったからね。でも、\n今のステージを見たら、心配なんて吹き飛んだよ！", "zh": "因为还有信的事嘛。不过，看了你现在的舞台，担心什么的全都烟消云散了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_124_1014_006mak", "source_sha256": "9dddbca4066f1011530e72a7b49433fcf42a935302f2909e9d9d2170261db635", "ja": "いつもどおりだけど、いつも以上にガツンと\n来たっていうか。ですよね、{$P$}？", "zh": "虽然和平常一样，但总觉得比平常\n更有冲击力呢。对吧，{$P$}？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_124_1015_p", "source_sha256": "a9be03b5af96508fc251761d8a3dcc11ae6c42b6fea949c7ae84ee25c717cc03", "ja": "そうだな。これだけのお客さんの熱量に、\nきっちり応えられたんだ。", "zh": "是啊。我们确实完美回应了这么多客人的热情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_124_1016_p", "source_sha256": "9d06779b9515a5970f560ba7508595b66b75700598ab0c3573ac02d1be2e4832", "ja": "春香のファンは、これからもっと増えていくはず……。\nだとすると、忙しくなるな！", "zh": "春香的粉丝，以后肯定会越来越多……。\n这么说来，要更忙了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_124_1017_001har", "source_sha256": "e4c73583037dd2cb2abac995dfa53b8a9e35205539081d6775e61f76da79ede8", "ja": "はい！\n覚悟は、とっくにできてますから！", "zh": "好的！\n我早就做好觉悟了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_124_1018_001har", "source_sha256": "62b8abf5457faac9c44066bf4ed7756fbd8cf02008353ddc977a5af81e45e0f8", "ja": "これからも、こうして……\nアイドルができたらいいな。……えへへ♪", "zh": "今后也能这样继续当偶像就好了……嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_124_1019_p", "source_sha256": "7861dc53a7bae8c5bab8043d8336afec476e338bc8efc569966cd3f76fd46eb4", "ja": "（春香の目指す道は、簡単じゃない……。けど、\nアイドルの覚悟に応えるのがプロデューサーの務めだ）", "zh": "（春香所选择的道路并不轻松……但是，回应她作为偶像的觉悟，正是制作人的职责。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_124_1020_p", "source_sha256": "3e2e87c9e5158b77f3a4cb61a4025d80c7f70694492f69aa50c1b0069bc543fc", "ja": "（どこまでも一緒に行くから、頑張ろうな！　春香！）", "zh": "（我会陪你一直走下去，所以一起加油吧！春香！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
